ailed'=>'Instalasi plugin gagal','Plugin main file not found'=>'File utama plugin tidak ditemukan','plugin selected'=>'plugin dipilih','Plugin sucessfully activated'=>'Plugin berhasil diaktifkan','Plugin sucessfully installed'=>'Plugin berhasil diinstal','Plugins'=>'Plugin','Plugins add new features and functionality to your WordPress site.'=>'Plugin menambahkan fitur dan fungsi baru ke situs WordPress Anda.','Plugins are apps that can be installed on your WordPress website. Each plugin lets you add a new feature, such as forms, SEO tools, or social media buttons. All of these plugins are free.'=>'Plugin adalah aplikasi yang bisa diinstal di website WordPress. Dengan plugin, Anda bisa menambahkan fitur baru seperti formulir, tool SEO, atau tombol media sosial. Semua plugin ini gratis.','plugins selected'=>'plugin dipilih','Pre-built websites and themes'=>'Tema dan website siap pakai','Premium template'=>'Template premium','Preview'=>'Pratinjau','Preview site'=>'Lihat situs','Preview website'=>'Pratinjau situs','Promote products on your site'=>'Promosikan produk di website Anda','Publish the page'=>'Onlinekan halaman','Recommended for you'=>'Rekomendasi untuk Anda','Recommended plugins'=>'Rekomendasi plugin','Registered at another provider'=>'Terdaftar di provider lain','Registering'=>'Memproses registrasi','Registering your domain'=>'Mendaftarkan domain Anda','Registration didn\'t work'=>'Registrasi gagal','Remind me later'=>'Ingatkan saya nanti','Renew'=>'Perpanjang','Resources'=>'Sumber Daya','Restore'=>'Pulihkan','Review'=>'Ulasan','Reviewing your domain'=>'Memverifikasi domain Anda','Run an Amazon Affiliate site'=>'Jalankan situs Amazon Affiliate','Run email marketing campaigns'=>'Jalankan email marketing campaign','Save'=>'Simpan','Saving'=>'Menyimpan','Search for a plugin'=>'Cari plugin','Search pages'=>'Cari halaman','Securely accept payments, synchronize sales, and seamlessly manage inventory and product data between WooCommerce and Square POS.'=>'Terima pem